# Documentation sync

Update documentation in the same PR when changing:

- build/toolchain assumptions;
- CLI or experiment entry points;
- datasets or evaluation semantics;
- capsule equations or routing behavior;
- CUDA memory layout or kernel mapping;
- tests, CI, or releases;
- branch/reproduction guidance.

Prefer updating the relevant spoke under `docs/` or `.cursor/` and linking from hubs instead of copying long explanations into README/AGENTS.
